      "value": "This is not an actionable bug report, unfortunately.\n\n> Please don't just merge this into the other thread.\n\nDuplicate of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/unblock-access-to-vrchat-for-shadow-pc-users\n\n> Are there any updates? What is going on?\n\n[VRChat Ask](https://ask.vrchat.com/) is for questions.",
